# The temporary dist `naming-settings-boot.spec.ts` compiles into, beside the
# package so `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json` resolves the same way it does in CI.
# `afterAll` removes it; an interrupt or a failed `tsc` does not, and a few
# hundred loose `.js` files under the package are otherwise stageable by
# `git add -A`.
/.naming-boot-*/
